  "description": "Fuji makes the streets safe\n\nwith two police-specific models: the Police Special SX and Patrol SX. They\n\nshare a 7005-series, double-butted, gussetted aluminum frame, and alloy seat\n\nand chain stays. They each have 27 gears controlled by Shimano and Sram twistgrip\n\nshifting, and alloy wheels built on Fuji and Shimano hubs, stainless steel\n\nspokes and Ritchey double-wall rims. The Fuji alloy handlebars come with bar\n\nends, the stems are adjustable for angle and the seatposts are suspension\n\nmodels. The rear derailleur hangers on both models are replaceable after tumbles\n\nor inevitable rough treatment.",
